sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Badge as UpdateBadgeView
    participant Modal as UpdateModalView
    participant UM as UpdateManager
    participant Server as SysCore API
    participant FS as Filesystem
    participant App as Aether.app

    Note over UM: App Launch (update.enabled = true)
    UM->>UM: Wait 5 seconds
    UM->>Server: GET /api/v1/aether/latest
    Server-->>UM: {version: "v0.4.0", changelog: "..."}
    UM->>UM: Compare v0.4.0 > v0.3.0 (local)
    UM->>Badge: State = .available("v0.4.0")
    Badge->>Badge: Fade in pill button

    User->>Badge: Clicks "Update v0.4.0"
    Badge->>Modal: Present modal
    Modal->>UM: downloadUpdate()
    UM->>Server: GET /api/v1/aether/download/bundle?v=v0.4.0
    loop Progress Updates
        Server-->>UM: Streamed chunks
        UM-->>Modal: Progress 0% → 100%
    end
    UM->>FS: Save to ~/Library/.../updates/v0.4.0/
    UM->>UM: Verify file size
    UM-->>Modal: State = .readyToInstall

    alt User clicks "Restart & Update"
        User->>Modal: Clicks "Restart & Update"
        Modal->>UM: applyUpdate()
        UM->>FS: Backup .app/Contents/ → backup/
        UM->>FS: tar -xzf bundle.tar.gz → .app/
        UM->>FS: codesign --force --deep --sign - .app
        UM->>FS: Set pendingUpdateVersion in UserDefaults
        UM->>FS: Clean up download artifacts
        UM->>App: NSWorkspace.open(Bundle.main.bundleURL)
        UM->>App: NSApp.terminate(nil)
        Note over App: New instance launches
        App->>App: Detect pendingUpdateVersion
        App->>User: Show Logo → "What's New" screen
        App->>App: Clear pendingUpdateVersion
    else User clicks "Later"
        User->>Modal: Clicks "Later"
        Modal->>Badge: Change to "Restart to Update"
        Note over Badge: Persists until restart
    end
